'''Bean starter''' is a type of seed. Mature plants yield [[Green Bean]]s.

They can be purchased at [[Pierre's General Store]], at [[JojaMart]], from the Magic Shop Boat at the [[Night Market]] on Winter 15, and occasionally from the [[Traveling Cart]]. They can also be made from the [[Seed Maker]].  Five to twenty Bean Starter may occasionally be found in [[Skull Cavern#Treasure Rooms|treasure rooms]] in the Skull Cavern. Eight to twenty Bean starter may be received from opening a [[Mystery Box]] or [[Golden Mystery Box]].

